---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Slovak Brain Drain" lang="en">
  <h1>Slovak Brain Drain</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">A data investigation into Slovakia's emigration since independence</p>

  <section class="summary">
    <p>Slovakia has lost more than 300,000 people to emigration since EU accession. This site maps where they went, why they left, and what was lost.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="sections-grid">
    <a href="/internal" class="section-card">
      <h2>Section 1: Internal Slovakia</h2>
      <p>Population change, migration flows, and regional divergence across 79 districts, 2004-2025.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/corridor" class="section-card">
      <h2>Section 2: The Czech Corridor</h2>
      <p>240,000 Slovaks in Czechia. The student pipeline, the labour pipeline, and the stay rate.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/diaspora" class="section-card">
      <h2>Section 3: Global Diaspora</h2>
      <p>Slovak-born populations in 87 countries. Where the brain drain actually goes.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/people" class="section-card">
      <h2>Section 4: Notable Departures</h2>
      <p>Individual stories that illustrate the structural patterns.</p>
    </a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  h1 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #666; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .summary { margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 680px; }
  .sections-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .section-card {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .section-card:hover { border-color: var(--color-accent, #c44d2b); }
  .section-card h2 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .section-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #555; }
</style>
